{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21316","headline":"遣悲怀三首 三 · 元稹","name":"遣悲怀三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲坐悲君亦自悲，百年都是几多时。\n邓攸无子寻知命，潘岳悼亡犹费词。\n同穴窅冥何所望，他生缘会更难期。\n唯将终夜长开眼，报荅平生未展眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","citation":"萧涤非"}